[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20227.59, "timestamp": "05:37:07", "text": "是的，我得搞清楚播放列表的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20230.91, "timestamp": "05:37:10", "text": "东西。那才是主要目标，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20233.75, "timestamp": "05:37:13", "text": "现在，因为一旦我弄清楚了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20237.19, "timestamp": "05:37:17", "text": "播放列表那玩意儿我能理解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20242.708, "timestamp": "05:37:22", "text": "呃，这可以做到，你知道怎么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20246.27, "timestamp": "05:37:26", "text": "继续下去还是怎样，我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20265.16, "timestamp": "05:37:45", "text": "一。也许我会做一套30个或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20268.11, "timestamp": "05:37:48", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20277.27, "timestamp": "05:37:57", "text": "也。我知道有些事可以帮到你。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20279.91, "timestamp": "05:37:59", "text": "没关系。通常都是这样。"}]